    {"id":"b10000000000000a","type":"text","x":-40,"y":-320,"width":760,"height":200,"text":"# DP map\n\nArrows = **builds on**. Green box = patterns you've solved with. Purple = what's next.\n\nDrag in a pattern note from the file list when you learn a new one, and draw the arrow from what it builds on."},
