    {"id":"d10000000000000a","type":"text","x":560,"y":860,"width":400,"height":200,"text":"## Tabulation (bottom-up)\nSame table, filled with a `for` loop instead of recursion.\n\nTry: rewrite Frog 1 without recursion."},
    {"id":"d10000000000000b","type":"text","x":1120,"y":860,"width":400,"height":200,"text":"## Grid DP\nState = `(row, col)`.\n\nTry: CSES *Grid Paths*."},
    {"id":"d10000000000000c","type":"text","x":1680,"y":860,"width":400,"height":200,"text":"## Swap the dimension\nWhen `W` is huge, index by value instead.\n\nTry: AtCoder DP *Knapsack 2*."},
    {"id":"d10000000000000d","type":"text","x":0,"y":860,"width":400,"height":200,"text":"## LIS\nState = \"longest ending at `i`\".\n\nTry: LeetCode 300, then CSES *Increasing Subsequence*."}
